      en: ["Catacamas is the largest municipality by area in Honduras.", "The city is home to the National University of Agriculture (UNAG).", "The nearby Talgua Caves date back to pre-Columbian times.", "Catacamas is situated at an elevation of about 450 meters.", "Livestock farming is the most important economic sector of the town.", "The municipality was officially established in 1898."],
