      en: ["Nacaome was officially founded in the year 1535.", "The name Nacaome means 'Two Races' in the indigenous language.", "Shrimp farming is a leading economic sector in the region.", "The Nacaome Dam is used for irrigation and power generation.", "The city is located only about 40 meters above sea level.", "Salt extraction is a traditional activity on the nearby coast."],
