      en: ["Santa Rosa de Copán sits at an elevation of about 1,150 meters.", "The city is home to the famous Flor de Copán cigar factory.", "It was officially elevated to city status in 1843.", "The historic city center is protected as a national monument.", "The region is celebrated for its world-class highland coffee.", "Santa Rosa is a key logistical hub in the western part of the country."],
